{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_026_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80921d109ec3c58de1aa65aa6f18f9043bc53f700e0fcaddbbc6a0fe9dac491d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a3d7c91400e654704fbaf4932b5d72f212fe263c470ffb481c45a92316e5aa",
      "text": "番长，现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06ee8009e90675442cb32b77023896d59a518d8b852bbbb8c2fb28a64e0d01d2",
      "text": "方便！没问题的。\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0025f8c23d1419bb695bd20581de3251d10937edb9aa1dc9f6800963645010ec",
      "text": "前阵子我把玩具送到福利院去了。\n是想来跟你报告一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc516e98108a3348b4442a3cf09e339adb69aa4ed2a9301ffd11ff682c58ede",
      "text": "每一个玩具，大家都非常喜欢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3d1a1c16858ad7425ac46d7e8f6a61f62c9ac1a0432d29423b51bee36d89593",
      "text": "那个编程玩具甚至都到了抢着玩的程度。\n哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:105a1f387df469273310188a6743988085f79c06fb07610bce20159c6b37486e",
      "text": "我也带了一句给陪我一起挑玩具的\n番长的口信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae06d658b3c99f79bc2be9daccdec19c8fb2b888d72bbbc67fbc5cd4a86775c2",
      "text": "“谢谢你帮我们挑了玩具”，他们这么说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29a075af63d33be45fd18ef913500beabfc1765f0b6d630eb066702bc8fdc492",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n能帮上忙真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:001428b30ba6a8dcad8b271b34911fdb7f273da1d7f7962cb88c52e0cfd4eac2",
      "text": "找番长商量果然是对的。\n真帮了大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ce6489cdf50f8cf23eee192519d30da51527616224c919ccdb076274e26bca6",
      "text": "报恩谢德。今后番长要是遇到什么事，\n不管多么微不足道，都尽管依靠我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
